    "show_share": true,
    "description": "An excavation led by ISMC's Dr Stephane Pradines has unearthed a treasure trove of discoveries. The dig on the tiny island of Mayotte, part of the Comoros archipelagos in the Western Indian Ocean, is held every year with the aim of understanding settlement patterns and discovering more about the people who lived and traded in this part of the world.",
